& [Purpose]
  + define the smallest production-broker implementation that can later own one exact C-drive P1 process attempt
  + close authentic commission continuous lease durable one-use consumption fresh-state and Windows descendant-containment semantics
  + authorize bounded implementation separately from physical activation
  + retain PreflightEligibleWriterNotRun under PreflightObservationOnly as the only possible later successful P1 receipt

