& [FiveAuthorityJoin]
  + authenticated_external_commission is one exact separately issued operator commission and authorization artifact
  + continuous_exclusive_lease is one no-share handle held from second observation through outcome consumption and evidence retention
  + durable_consumption_claim is one flushed reopened byte-verified Unclaimed-to-Claimed transition in a pre-existing fixed ledger
  + production_broker_prepared_receipt binds pre-existing broker lease ledger evidence and retained worktree coordinates
  + fresh_phase3a_replay is acquired immediately before lease and repeated after lease for mutable-state correspondence
  + all five are required and fixtures never satisfy an authentic physical join

