  + profile is cantor-self-work-update-broker-b1-cdrive-production-commission/0.1
  + issuer is THEBRAIN\enjer subject is cantor_b1_cdrive_production_broker_p0 and recovery owner is THEBRAIN\enjer
  + exact fields bind commission attempt conversation purpose implementation bookend expected-current plan prepared receipt Phase3A lease ledger evidence issued-at expires-at maximum attempts one retry count zero and self-digest
  + operator authorization is a distinct exact self-digested external artifact and cannot be authored by the broker
  + commission must be current unconsumed and exactly addressed; unknown duplicate reordered stale aliased or substituted input refuses

& [BrokerPreparation]
  + exact scratch candidate evidence CODEX_HOME temp lease and ledger coordinates are canonical strict descendants of C:\Project\CantorWorktrees\swa05_b1_cdrive_preflight_*
  + candidate shares exact common directory with C:\Project\Cantor while remaining strictly nonoverlapping and on C-drive
  + lease ledger and evidence directory pre-exist as regular nonlink disjoint roles and ledger has fixed length with canonical Unclaimed bytes
  + prepared receipt joins worktree request filesystem Git PreparedForPhase3aAcquisition outcome executable and producer-plan digests
  + formation fixtures may model preparation but no live prepared receipt exists under this specification

& [StateMachine]
  + exact nonterminal states are InputsValidated LeaseHeld StateReobserved ConsumptionClaimed PermitIssued ChildrenRunning EvidenceRetained CommissionConsumed LeaseReleased
  + exact terminals are Complete NotRun and Quarantined
  + sequence is validate inputs observe capacity and mutable state acquire exclusive lease reobserve claim ledger reopen verify construct private permit execute children retain evidence mark commission consumed release lease complete
  + pre-claim failure yields NotRun with process creation count zero
  + any post-claim failure ambiguity timeout policy refusal or crash yields Quarantined and may_have_mutated true unless independent evidence proves a narrower fact
  + no state transition retry reset deletion replacement cleanup or evidence overwrite is implicit

& [ExecutionPermit]
  + permit type is private nonserializable nonclone nondefault and absent from public constructors
  + constructor requires exact validated commission authorization preparation Phase3A capacity lease and claimed-ledger guards in one lifetime-bound broker state
  + permit binds attempt plan second-observation and claimed-ledger digests and is consumed exactly once
  + fake fixtures exercise broker ordering through a separate test-only backend without producing the physical permit

& [WindowsContainment]
  + target backend uses pinned windows-sys 0.61.2 Foundation Pipes Storage FileSystem JobObjects and Threading bindings
  + CreateProcessW receives non-null exact executable application mutable exact quoted command line explicit Unicode environment exact cwd STARTUPINFOEXW and PROCESS_INFORMATION
  + flags are CREATE_SUSPENDED CREATE_UNICODE_ENVIRONMENT CREATE_NO_WINDOW and EXTENDED_STARTUPINFO_PRESENT only plus any separately enumerated standard priority default
  + a fresh unnamed job is configured first with JOB_OBJECT_LIMIT_KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE and without BREAKAWAY_OK or SILENT_BREAKAWAY_OK
  + PROC_THREAD_ATTRIBUTE_HANDLE_LIST contains only exact child-side stdin stdout and stderr handles and parent sides are noninheritable
  + process is assigned to the job while suspended and ResumeThread must return exactly one before any protocol byte is sent
  + assignment hierarchy refusal resume drift handle failure and Windows error retain bounded numeric fault evidence without bypass

& [ChildPlan]
  + exactly four direct manager children execute sequentially in producer-plan order Version StandardSchema ExperimentalSchema AppServer
  + every child gets a fresh job and exact executable argv cwd seven-name environment timeout stdin output and exit policy from the compiled plan
  + version and schema jobs require maximum active one total processes exactly one terminal active zero and no late output
  + App Server job requires maximum active two total processes at most four terminal active zero and exact twelve-frame protocol
  + manager direct child count is four and aggregate job total process count is bounded at seven
  + timeout output overflow reader fault nonzero forbidden exit protocol fault or excess job count terminates the job waits drains and quarantines after claim

